job_description:
1. 负责具体超声产品的市场策略制定对应4P策略，协助销售团队对产品进行销售，达成目标；
2. 协助销售团队对产品进行宣传推介并提供技术支持；
3. 负责产品生命周期管理及竞争对手情况调研，与通过内部沟通协调提升产品竞争力；
4. 参与部门内部其他市场工作。

1. 本科以上学历，医学相关专业优先;
2. 5年及以上超声销售或市场工作经历，临床背景优先;
3. 英语基础良好，能够熟练使用EXCEL、WORD、 PPT 等办公软件及办公工具;
4. 性格外向，具备良好的沟通协调能力与组织能力，抗压能力强;
5. 能适应一定频率的出差。

1. Forecasts and plans individual selling target, executes and drives results to meet a set target;
2. Keeps follow-up with existing orders end to end to ensure the smoothness of order fulfillment;
3. Manages and supports distributors of assigned region;
4. Explores new promising overseas market, and works to enhance Mindray product branding recognition in the local area as well as improve market coverage;
5. Presents Mindray products in professional fairs and exhibitions;
6. Keeps management informed by submitting activity reports, work plan and territory market analyses;
7. Monitors competition by gathering current marketplace information on pricing, products, new products, delivery schedules;
8. Resolves customer complaints by investigating problems, developing solutions, preparing reports and making recommendations to management team;
9. Coordinates Service team to solve customer complaints;
